e and multi-protocol label switching services; information technology and network technologies; cable access network services; telecommunications technical consulting services; and season games through television, smartphones, tablets, personal computers, and other streaming devices. Additionally, the company owns Toronto Blue Jays and the Rogers Centre event venue; and operates Sportsnet ONE, Sportsnet 360, Sportsnet World, Citytv, OMNI, FX (Canada), FXX (Canada), and HGTV television networks, as well as AM and FM radio stations. It also offers Rogers and the Rogers Red World Elite Mastercard. The company was founded in 1960 and is headquartered in Toronto, Canada.", "sector": "Communication Services", "industry": "Telecom Services"}, "valuation": {"pe": 3.798313, "pb": 1.4885944, "ps": 1.2043099, "roe": 40.67, "net_margin": 31.74, "debt_to_equity": 184.2, "div_yield": 4.04, "rev_growth": 10.2, "market_cap": 26757357568.0, "forward_pe": 9.824009, "peg": 0.863, "payout": 15.34, "five_yr_yield": 3.69, "pe_sector_med": 8.649193, "pb_sector_med": 1.5084627, "roe_sector_med": 31.49, "div_yield_sector_med": 5.38}, "archetype": "mixed", "archetype_label": "Mixed profile", "archetype_label_zh": "\u6df7\u5408\u7279\u5f81", "consensus": {"n_analysts": 17, "target_mean": 60.44118, "target_high": 74.0, "target_low": 50.0, "rating_mean": 2.05882, "rating": "Buy", "rating_zh": "\u4e70\u5165", "upside_pct": 22.0}, "positioning": {"shares_short": 11832574.0, "days_to_cover": 6.2, "short_pct_float": null, "held_insiders": 10.64, "held_institutions": 63.2}}, "earnings": {"next_date": "2026-07-22", "surprises": [{"date": "2026-04-22", "eps": 1.01, "est": 1.02, "surprise_pct": -1.2}, {"date": "2026-01-29", "eps": 1.51, "est": 1.4, "surprise_pct": 7.6}, {"date": "2025-10-23", "eps": 1.37, "est": 1.24, "surprise_pct": 10.4}, {"date": "2025-07-23", "eps": 1.14, "est": 1.1, "surprise_pct": 3.4}]}, "factor_beta": {"oil": -0.037, "gold": 0.019, "cad": 0.468, "r2": 0.03, "n": 504, "primary":